Lyra
====

Lyra is a privacy-focused browser. It is not Mozilla Firefox.
The product name is Lyra.

Firefox-derived files
---------------------
Firefox is a trademark of the Mozilla Foundation. Lyra does not use Mozilla
or Firefox trademarks as the product name. Engine code comes from Mozilla
Firefox source tarballs under MPL-2.0. This git repository does not vendor
that source.

Lyra mark
---------
The Lyra bird-and-ring mark is product branding. It is not Mozilla
artwork. Do not use Mozilla's official Firefox branding. Source art lives at
branding/lyra/assets/lyra-mark.png.

Space Mono
----------
Space Mono Bold is included under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 for generating
the LYRA wordmark. See branding/lyra/fonts/OFL.txt.
Copyright 2016 The Space Mono Project Authors
https://github.com/googlefonts/spacemono

uBlock Origin
-------------
uBlock Origin is copyright Raymond Hill and contributors, licensed under
GPL-3.0-only. Lyra does not vendor the XPI in git. The fetch script downloads
a hash-pinned signed XPI from upstream. See extensions/ublock/.

LibreWolf and arkenfox
----------------------
Vendor prefs and policies are inspired by LibreWolf settings and arkenfox
user.js. Those projects remain copyright their authors under their licenses.
Lyra does not copy their full files. Citations live in prefs/lyra.cfg.

No analytics
------------
Lyra does not add first-party telemetry, crash phone-home, or usage analytics.
